{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"08ab CRITICAL FINDING (Phase 4e validation): held-out oracle GREEN (27/27) + mutation teeth confirmed for grounding tools/index/optionality. BUT production plan-review tool-routing (AC6-AC7) is wired to the WRONG seam: subagent wired RunnerAgentStep.tool_provider via gate_dispatch.produce_plan_review_verdict, but ProductionBatchRunner.run() does 'del agent_runner' (intentionally unused) and drives run_pass1 -> sizing.pass1_with_ladder -> pass1_chunk with the plain Runner. Terraform tools are DEAD CODE on the live gate. Correct seam: thread a per-call T10-scoped Terraform tool set into RunRequest.extra_tools inside pass1_chunk (Runner appends req.extra_tools to agentic tool list at runner.py:434), minting+finalizing a session per T10 agentic call and folding usage into the read-set. pass1.py/passes.py were in file_impact but untouched. Re-dispatching subagent for the real fix + authoring held-out production-path oracle. NOT pushing 08ab until AC6-AC7 met on the live path."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788487558416071001,"uuid":"9ebf1461-e69c-4e75-b39b-45d70840db41"}